# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Linux ASan/UBSan job (native-tests).
#
# SDL loads libX11 at run time and unloads it again in SDL_Quit. Allocations
# libX11 and libxkbcommon made on behalf of X11_VideoInit (resource database,
# keyboard maps, XRandR data) are then reported as leaks with "<unknown
# module>" frames because the library that owned the pointers is gone; they
# are not allocated or retained by PrismatiX code. Only leaks whose stack
# passes through SDL's X11 video initialization are suppressed.
leak:X11_VideoInit
# libdxcompiler (DirectXShaderCompiler) never frees its default include
# handler; it is reached only through the offline shader compiler.
leak:CreateDefaultIncludeHandler
